WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Let Jev judge. Let your code decide.
An offline walkthrough using synthetic judgments. No API key needed.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:16.000
A judgment is evidence.
Confidence 0.72 is below the 0.80 route threshold. The policy falls back.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:27.000
Same evidence. Different policy.
Lower the threshold to 0.70 and the proposed queue changes. Nothing is applied.

4
00:00:27.000 --> 00:00:35.000
Replay the policy.
Eight constructed cases match their expected decisions at the default thresholds.

5
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Test the code around the model.
Offline tests check boundaries and failure paths. SDK transport tests are skipped.

6
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Try Jevidence.
Clone the repository and run the demo. Read the companion guide for the design.
